Hi Tiago,

I added a vignette to the latest version of the AICcmodavg package yesterday (version 2.3-2) to illustrate different tools and diagnostics useful for unmarked models, including how to account for overdispersion in your inferences. The new version of the package is on CRAN now for Linux and Mac, and should appear in the following days for Windows. To see the vignette, you can issue the following command in the R terminal:

vignette("AICcmodavg-unmarked")

Best,

Marc

